flathub:io.github.hafmed.Hydraulics-Chan.description:
Application used to compute water surface profiles in a prismatic channel for gradually varied flow.
 Features:
 Calculate water-surface elevation;
 Use different numerical methods;
 Export results as graphics or as tables;
 Use SI or imperial system of units;
 English and French GUI;

